# Firmware stand-ins for the kingst-la2016 model
# (emu/src/models/kingst-la2016/mod.rs): the MCU firmware the driver
# uploads to the bare FX2 (its name built from the product id) and the
# FPGA bitstream of each emulated model. The sizes are those of the
# model's constants, which a unit test checks; they are not the sizes
# of the vendor's files, which the model does not need (it checks the
# stand-ins byte for byte).
kingst-la-01a2.fw 6221
kingst-la2016a1-fpga.bitstream 149461
kingst-la2016-fpga.bitstream 149333
kingst-la1016-fpga.bitstream 149205
kingst-la1016a1-fpga.bitstream 149077
kingst-la1010a1-fpga.bitstream 148949
kingst-la5016a1-fpga.bitstream 340181
kingst-la5032a0-fpga.bitstream 340053
